      "widgets_values": [
        "Continuing exactly from the reference frame: the same woman with warm brown skin, a dark curly updo and an oat chunky knit sweater sits in the vintage sleeper train window seat, eyes open, gazing left toward the window. Right away she turns her head and shoulders decisively from the window to face the lens in one smooth motion, meeting the camera with a warm, confident smile, loose curls swinging with the turn. Through the window, golden fields, trees and fence lines streak past fast in clear horizontal motion blur, and broad bands of golden sunlight sweep across her face, sweater and the wood paneling. The camera pushes in smoothly from medium to medium-close, keeping her face centered and her hands below frame. Same compartment, no other people. Natural skin texture, soft film grain, one continuous shot.",
